# C# and .NET Projects Portfolio

## Overview

This repository contains projects completed during my C# and .NET Software Development coursework. These projects demonstrate my understanding of object-oriented programming, ASP.NET MVC, Entity Framework, database management, and software development best practices.

## Projects Included

### Car Insurance ASP.NET MVC Application

A web application that generates insurance quotes based on customer information.

#### Features

* Customer quote generation
* Quote calculation logic
* Administrative quote management
* Entity Framework database integration

### Twenty One Game

A console application that simulates a Blackjack card game.

#### Features

* Object-oriented design
* Exception handling
* Player management
* Card deck operations

### Employee Management System

A C# application demonstrating CRUD operations and data management.

